[{"answer":"Hello and welcome to today's 'Buyer Beware' programme,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/1.mp3"},{"answer":"where we give you some tips on how to spend your money wisely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, in today's show we're looking at beds for children and babies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start by looking at baby cots,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/4.mp3"},{"answer":"that's for children of up to three years old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We tested three different cots all in the budget price range and, as usual,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/6.mp3"},{"answer":"we will feature the good points, the problems and our verdict.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The first cot we looked at was by Baby Safe","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and it had several good points to recommend it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Our testers liked the fact that it had four wheels,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/10.mp3"},{"answer":"so it was easy to move around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/11.mp3"},{"answer":"The only slight problems with this cot were that it had no brakes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/12.mp3"},{"answer":"but they didn't think that mattered too much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/13.mp3"},{"answer":"At first they were a bit concerned about the side bar,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/14.mp3"},{"answer":"because they felt babies could trap their fingers in it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but our testers felt that this was unlikely to happen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/16.mp3"},{"answer":"so they have given this one a verdict of 'satisfactory'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/17.mp3"},{"answer":"The next cot was by Choice Cots","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and this time our testers were pleased to find a cot which is simple to put together -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/19.mp3"},{"answer":"unlike others we looked at.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/20.mp3"},{"answer":"On the minus side, our testers did not like the fact that the side of the cot did not drop down,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/21.mp3"},{"answer":"making it difficult to pick up newborn babies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/22.mp3"},{"answer":"However, the real problem with this cot was the space between the bars;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/23.mp3"},{"answer":"our testers found they were too wide","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and a baby could easily trap his head.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/25.mp3"},{"answer":"We felt this was a real safety hazard","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/26.mp3"},{"answer":"and so we have labelled this one dangerous, I'm afraid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally better news for the Mother's Choice cot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/28.mp3"},{"answer":"This cot was slightly different in that, although the side bar did not drop down,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/29.mp3"},{"answer":"the base could be raised or lowered into two different positions","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/30.mp3"},{"answer":"making it safe as well as convenient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The negatives for this one were quite minor;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/32.mp3"},{"answer":"the only niggle everyone had was the fact that it has no wheels","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and the only other problem anyone could find was that there were pictures","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/34.mp3"},{"answer":"which were simply stuck on and so could easily become detached.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The makers have now promised to discontinue this practice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/36.mp3"},{"answer":"As this cot will then be safe in every way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/37.mp3"},{"answer":"we have made the Mother's Choice cot our best buy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Congratulations Mother's Choice!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/39.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what features should you look for in a baby's cot?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well obviously safety is a very important factor as well as comfort and convenience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/41.mp3"},{"answer":"We recommend that, if you are buying a cot,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/42.mp3"},{"answer":"do make sure that any metal present is not rusted or bent in any way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/43.mp3"},{"answer":"You should ensure your cot has only rounded or smooth edging without any sharp edges,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/44.mp3"},{"answer":"this is especially important for wooden cots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/45.mp3"},{"answer":"And now on to beds...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-1-part-2-2023-08-04-13-17-12/46.mp3"}]
